# Routing

Use Atomic Router.

## Rules

- Do not use React Router.
- Do not introduce another routing solution.
- Do not generate route architecture unless explicitly requested.
- Wait for route structure definition from the project owner.
- Keep routing connected to Effector where appropriate.

## Ownership

The project owner defines the routing architecture.

When route architecture is not provided, ask for clarification instead of inventing it.
